{"speciesId":788,"names":{"fr":"Tokopisco","es":"Tapu Fini","en":"Tapu Fini","ja":"カプ・レヒレ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il confond ses ennemis grâce au brouillard et les pousse à s’en prendre à eux-mêmes. Il puise son énergie dans les courants marins."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Desconcierta al enemigo provocando una espesa niebla que se convierte en su perdición. Las corrientes marinas son su fuente de energía."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The dense fog it creates brings the downfall and destruction of its confused enemies. Ocean currents are the source of its energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"深い霧で 敵を 惑わせ 自滅させる 恐ろしさを 持つ。 海流が エネルギーの 源。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Gardien de Poni, il a le pouvoir de contrôler l’eau. On raconte qu’il peut produire une eau limpide qui nettoie toutes les impuretés."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es el espíritu guardián de Poni y tiene control sobre el agua. Dicen que puede purificar cualquier impureza con su agua límpida."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The guardian deity of Poni, it can control water. People say it can create pure water that will wash away any uncleanness."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"水を 操る ポニの 守り神。 けがれを 払う 清らかな 水を 生みだすと 伝えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Gardien de Poni et maître de l’eau, il vit au plus profond de la brume. C’est notamment pour cette raison qu’il est à la fois craint et vénéré."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El espíritu guardián de Poni, temido y venerado a la vez. Mora en una espesa niebla y manipula el agua a su antojo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This guardian deity of Poni Island manipulates water. Because it lives deep within a thick fog, it came to be both feared and revered."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"深い 霧の 奥に 棲んでいると 恐れ 敬われてきた。 水を 操る ポニの 守り神だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il ne faut pas se laisser berner par son statut de divinité protectrice : il lui arrive de mettre en pièces ceux qui osent s’approcher de trop près."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A pesar de ser un espíritu guardián, trae desgracias a aquellos que se le acercan sin la debida cortesía."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Although it’s called a guardian deity, terrible calamities sometimes befall those who recklessly approach Tapu Fini."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"守り神と 呼ばれるが 無闇に 近付く 相手には 恐ろしい 災いを もたらすこともある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":788,"moves":[{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[17,"level-up",58],[18,"level-up",58],[20,"level-up",65],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"withdraw","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"haze","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"waterfall","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18